sumo — https://github.com/SMTG-Bham/sumo

The Bradley-Cracknell high-symmetry k-point table bundled at
valyte/data/bradcrack.json is sumo's table, reproduced with different
formatting; the parsed contents are identical. The BradCrackKpath class in
valyte/band.py, and in particular its _get_bravais_lattice method, is adapted
from sumo's sumo/symmetry/brad_crack_kpath.py.

